    "created_at": "2026-01-14T19:45:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-14T19:45:23Z",
    "body": "I agree that DAS seems obvious since \"Device\" is in the name however given the lack of group participation by Mozilla I don't think that is a good venue. A WebKit position wouldn't change that since Apple isn't a participant either.\n\nI was going to nominate WebApps given it maintains the Gamepad API, which is both similar as a peripheral API and has overlap in the engineers working as editors and implementers.\n\nSpinning up a new WG seems like a lot of work but once Mozilla gets a little farther in their prototyping work we can look into it.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
