    "created_at": "2026-01-14T21:39:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-14T21:39:29Z",
    "body": "My recommendation is to make this a joint deliverable between the DAS WG and WebApps WG. The infrastructure is in place and in use.\n\nBased on my assessment, a new WG would be too costly and is unlikely to garner support from the W3C membership.",
