    "updated_at": "2026-01-15T09:50:54Z",
    "body": "> I agree that DAS seems obvious since \"Device\" is in the name however given the lack of group participation by Mozilla I don't think that is a good venue.\n\nAt the risk of pointing out something that is clear to everyone with a longer history in the DAS WG: did Mozilla consider joining the group at some point and decided against to, and if so, maybe would they be willing to join now? ",
