    "updated_at": "2026-01-15T10:31:49Z",
    "body": "Mozilla has participated the DAS WG and has implemented and shipped APIs produced by the group in its now discontinued FirefoxOS product and certain versions of its Firefox browser. Re-joining WGs is normal and happens from time to time when companies' priorities change. I welcome Mozilla back to the DAS WG.\n\nWe have initiated charter refinement process to seek W3C community consensus on this important matter.",
